<title>UK: Vitec year underlying profit up 19 pct.</title>
<headline>Vitec year underlying profit up 19 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31</p>
<p>		    (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		55.0		   vs 52.3</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 8.9		    vs 7.7</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 12.1		   vs 10.5</p>
<p> Pretax		     52.6		   vs 30.7</p>
<p> Turnover		   148.5		  vs 131.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Above 1996 pretax includes an exceptional profit of 16 million stg on the sale of a unit. Excluding the gain, the pretax profit was 36.6 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Vitec Group Plc. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
